+| selected Stage 4 tree | `d49890923ce962cb9a9019e6441aa7c9197de5db97aa927b4f2219ada3df1e7c` |
+| generated project tree | `3553ce22a41487aaabb785935fbee17b25ee50dc4836b9773d7f68cacd82aa6b` |
